  "keyFeatures": [
    "High-performance runtime mesh rendering as a replacement for ProceduralMeshComponent",
    "LOD (Level of Detail) support for procedural meshes",
    "Async mesh updates with future-based completion callbacks",
    "Full Blueprint support for mesh creation and modification",
    "Complex and simple collision generation from mesh data",
    "Nanite support for high-polygon procedural geometry",
    "Lumen distance field and card representation support",
    "Flexible stream-based mesh data API with type-safe builders",
    "Network replication support for mesh components",
    "Polygon group / multi-material section support"
  ],
